    "title": "Landscaping Maintenance Contract Pricing: Scope and Visits",
    "seoTitle": "Landscaping Maintenance Contract Pricing",
    "description": "Build landscaping maintenance contract pricing from annual visits, labor and seasonal tasks. Test scope changes, monthly billing and peak crew capacity.",
    "metaDescription": "Build landscaping maintenance contract pricing from annual visits, labor and seasonal tasks. Test scope changes, monthly billing and peak crew capacity.",
